# Uploads / local data
*.csv

# The FIRMS training archive (~10 GB of NASA area exports) and the forecast checkpoint
# trained from it. Both are local: `python firecal/backend/train.py` rebuilds the
# checkpoint from `.data/`, and the API works without either.
.data/
firecal/backend/model/

# The harmonized-year dataset staged for `hf sync ./data hf://buckets/…`. Derived: it is
# rebuilt from `.data/` by `firecal/backend/hf_export.py` and published to the Hugging Face
# bucket, which is where it lives. A manifest and dataset card go with it.
data/

